<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 3.1 POINTS TO 801.5 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 3.1 POINTS TO 801.5 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 3.1 points on Tuesday to 801.5, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the chemistry index losing the most, down 9.6 points, or 2.46 percent, to 381.2 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
